  "source": "CarePoint healthcare-suite/backend",
  "adaptations": [
    "Remove Nest dependency injection and replace HTTP exceptions with dependency-free equivalents.",
    "CSV store is separate, branch-partitioned in-memory demo storage; original typed CSV schema and coercion retained.",
    "Actor stamping and authenticated session are supplied by adapter rather than source users.csv.",
    "Input validation, rollback and replay protection are implemented by adapter.",
    "Billing.create validates aggregate stock consumption against its single billing preview; original per-line checks could oversell repeated items."
